    "created_at": "2019-03-23T13:25:03Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-03-23T13:37:08Z",
    "body": "Oh, interesting. `HttpResponseHeaders::IsRedirect` still believes it's possible. I guess we missed updating that comment.\r\n\r\nAlthough I see that this check is implemented in the HTTP/1.1 parser (which makes some sense since HTTP/1.1 is the one with the absurdly fragile text encoding), so it may differ in HTTP/2 and QUIC, just to make things more fun...",
