    "created_at": "2024-08-19T16:48:57Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-08-19T16:48:57Z",
    "body": "Arguably everything discussed in this issue falls under that undefined behavior umbrella. Of course, that's not good enough from the web's perspective and we need to write down the full behavior in Fetch (hence this ticket still being open). But unless the IETF wants to widen `Location`'s ABNF, seems the IANA registration wants to stay as is.",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
